{
  "title": "Dua for Istikharah fom Holy Quran",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "It is worth mentioning that ‘Allamah al-Majlisi has reported from some books written by our scholars on the authority of a book handwritten by Shaykh Yusuf al-Usmani on the authority of a book handwritten by Ayatollah ‘Allamah who said that Imam al-Sadiq (a.s.) is reported to have said:\nIf you intend for Istekharah from the Mighty Book (i.e. the Holy Qur’an), you may say this supplicatory prayer:\nبِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّ حْمٰنِ الرَّ حِيْمِ اِنْ كَانَ فِىْ قَضَاۤئِكَ وَقَدَرِكَ اَنْتَمُنَّ عَلٰى شِيْعَةِ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ عَلَيْهِمُ السَّلَامُ بِفَرَجِ وَلِيِّكَ وَ حُجَّتِكَ عَلٰى خَلْقِكَ فَاَخْرِجْ اِلَيْنَاۤ اٰيَةً مِنْ كِتَابِكَ نَسْتَدِلُّ بِهَا عَلٰى ذٰلِكَ.\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEME IN KAANA FEE QAZAAA-EKA WA QADAREKA AN TAMUNNA A’LAA SHEE-A’TE AALE MOHAMMADIN A’LAYHEMUS SALAAMO BE-FARAJE WALIYYEKA WA HUJJATEKA A’LAA KHALQEKA FA-AKHRIJ ELAYNAA AAYATAN MIN KETAABEKA NASTADILLO BEHAA A’LAA ZAALEKA.\nIn the name of Allah, the All-Beneficent, the All-Merciful. If it is within Your decree and Your destiny to bestow favor upon the followers (Shia) of the family of Muhammad—peace be upon them—with the relief (Faraj) of Your representative and Your Proof over Your creation, then bring forth to us a sign from Your Book by which we may find evidence of that.\nYou may then open the copy of the Holy Qur’an, count six pages, count six lines of the seventh page, and see what is written therein.”"
}
